2:T1017,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/flora-alternative#article","headline":"The best Flora alternative for creative teams","description":"Looking for a Flora alternative? Flora (Florafauna) and Melius are the two node canvases most often compared, so \"we have a canvas and an agent\" isn't the difference. The real gaps are collaboration, learning curve, and pricing. Here's how Melius handles the same work with true real-time multiplayer.","url":"https://www.melius.com/blog/flora-alternative","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/flora-alternative"},"datePublished":"2026-07-21","dateModified":"2026-07-21","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Melius Team","url":"https://www.melius.com"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#organization"},"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#website"},"inLanguage":"en-US","image":"https://www.melius.com/images/blog/flora-alternative/cover.webp","timeRequired":"PT6M","wordCount":657,"articleSection":"Comparisons","keywords":"Comparisons"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Blog","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"The best Flora alternative for creative teams","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog/flora-alternative"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best Flora alternative?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Melius is the closest and strongest Flora alternative. Both are node-based creative canvases that aggregate many models, pair a canvas with an AI agent, and offer real-time multiplayer, so the decision comes down to execution: Melius adds an agent that also runs in Slack, several agents working at once with visible presence, a gentler learning curve because Mel does the node-wiring for you, and every model under one credit pool."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is Melius different from Flora?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Both have a node canvas, an agent and real-time multiplayer, so the honest differences are concrete. Melius has been stress-tested past 200 nodes on one canvas, where teams report Flora's canvas starting to strain; every asset you generate is semantically searchable instead of filed away to scroll; and the agent runs the full request-to-download loop in Slack with several agents working at once, rather than a single browser-tab assistant."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Melius have as many models as Flora?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Both platforms give you the major frontier image, video and audio models in one place, including the Flux family, Nano Banana Pro, Seedream, Kling, Veo, Sora and Seedance. Neither locks you to a single provider; you pick the right model per node."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Flora the same as Florafauna?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Flora is the product from Florafauna (florafauna.ai), and its built-in agent is named FAUNA. When people compare a Flora alternative, they mean this node-based canvas. Melius is the closest like-for-like: a node canvas plus an agent, but with an agent that also runs in Slack and concurrently, a gentler learning curve, and one shared credit pool."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Melius easier to learn than Flora?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It aims to be. Flora is explicitly pitched at technical teams comfortable with node systems, and reviewers suggest budgeting a full day before you're productive. Melius keeps the same node power but lets Mel build and wire the graph from a brief, so you can steer in plain language instead of assembling every node by hand."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Melius handle video work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Melius routes to frontier video models and includes an in-app multi-track editor to assemble the result. Because every model shares one credit pool, you can compare a shot across Kling, Veo and Seedance without juggling separate budgets."}}]}]}7:X
