17:["$","p","b959",{"children":["Both tools have a node canvas, an agent and multiplayer, so the honest comparison is the concrete places they diverge, not who has an agent."]}]
18:["$","ul","b962-parent",{"children":[["$","li","b962",{"children":[["$","strong","b960",{"children":["Scale that holds up past 50 nodes. "]}],"Melius has been stress-tested past 200 nodes on a single canvas, so a multi-scene project stays responsive as the graph fills up, exactly where teams report Flora's canvas starting to strain."]}],["$","li","b965",{"children":[["$","strong","b963",{"children":["Search with AI. "]}],"Every generation and upload is auto-indexed by what is actually in it, so you can search \"the neon product shot on black\" and land on it. Flora gives you files to scroll; there is no semantic search over your own library."]}],["$","li","b968",{"children":[["$","strong","b966",{"children":["The agent works where Flora's can't. "]}],"FAUNA lives in a single browser tab, one agent, one step at a time. Mel runs the full request-approve-download loop inside Slack, and several agents can work the same canvas at once with visible presence, so the difference isn't 'has an agent', it's how far it reaches and how many run."]}],["$","li","b971",{"children":[["$","strong","b969",{"children":["Teach it your brand once. "]}],"Store brand instructions plus reference images and save custom slash-command skills, and the agent applies them to every generation, instead of re-selecting reference nodes each turn."]}],["$","li","b977",{"children":[["$","strong","b972",{"children":["Every model, one subscription. "]}],"Image, video and audio models share ",["$","$L2c","b975",{"link":{"_type":"link","_key":"b974","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false},"children":["a single subscription"]}]," with unlimited agent usage, so comparing a shot across Kling, Veo and Seedance is a routing choice, not a budgeting headache."]}]]}]
