1f:["$","div","b1065",{"className":"faq-list my-10 flex flex-col divide-y divide-black/10 border-y border-black/10","children":[["$","details","0",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What is the best Flora alternative?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Melius is the closest and strongest Flora alternative. Both are node-based creative canvases that aggregate many models, pair a canvas with an AI agent, and offer real-time multiplayer, so the decision comes down to execution: Melius adds an agent that also runs in Slack, several agents working at once with visible presence, a gentler learning curve because Mel does the node-wiring for you, and every model under one credit pool."}]]}],["$","details","1",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How is Melius different from Flora?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Both have a node canvas, an agent and real-time multiplayer, so the honest differences are concrete. Melius has been stress-tested past 200 nodes on one canvas, where teams report Flora's canvas starting to strain; every asset you generate is semantically searchable instead of filed away to scroll; and the agent runs the full request-to-download loop in Slack with several agents working at once, rather than a single browser-tab assistant."}]]}],["$","details","2",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Does Melius have as many models as Flora?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Both platforms give you the major frontier image, video and audio models in one place, including the Flux family, Nano Banana Pro, Seedream, Kling, Veo, Sora and Seedance. Neither locks you to a single provider; you pick the right model per node."}]]}],["$","details","3",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Is Flora the same as Florafauna?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":"$L30"}]]}],"$L31"]}],"$L32","$L33"]}]
20:["$","section","related",{"className":"relative w-full pb-section bg-gray-background","children":[["$","$L11",null,{"color":"gray"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-300 px-5 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h-2 mb-12 text-center text-balance text-gray-dark-1","children":"Related Articles"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-max grid-cols-1 gap-11 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","$L34","post-magnific-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-magnific-alternative","slug":"magnific-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Magnific alternative for upscaling and creative AI","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Magnific alternative? Magnific's creative upscaler is a strong specialist, but if upscaling is one step in a real production, not the whole tool, and you'd rather not pay premium rates for a no-refund, credit-metered enhancer, here's how Melius folds generation, editing, resizing and assembly onto one canvas.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/magnific-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Magnific alternative?","answer":"Melius is the strongest alternative for teams. Magnific is a capable, well-funded platform, a real node canvas with an in-canvas agent, a timeline editor and model training on top of its best-in-class upscaler, so this isn't a canvas-versus-no-canvas comparison. The wedge is agent reach: on Melius the agent also runs inside Slack, the MCP is canvas-level so an external agent can build and run the canvas itself, teams teach it their brand as reusable slash-command skills, and self-serve plans include up to 8 seats, Enterprise includes unlimited seats, and agent usage is unlimited."},{"question":"Does Melius upscale and resize images like Magnific?","answer":"Yes. Melius includes magic resize and image enhancement as steps on the canvas, alongside background removal and other edits. The difference is that these live inside an end-to-end workflow: generate, edit, resize and hand off, rather than a standalone upscaler you round-trip through."},{"question":"Why do people look for a Magnific alternative?","answer":"Commonly cited reasons: it is priced at the premium end with no free trial and a strict no-refund policy, its creative upscaling can \"overcook\" images and invent detail that drifts from the original, and heavy trial-and-error burns credits. Its agent and MCP are also generation-focused rather than driving the canvas remotely, and there is no native Slack workflow, so teams that want an agent reaching across their whole stack look elsewhere."},{"question":"How does Magnific AI work?","answer":"Magnific is a creative upscaler: you feed it an image and it enlarges it while inventing plausible new detail, texture and lighting, with sliders to control how much it reimagines versus preserves the original. That hallucination is its strength and its risk, which is why control over how much it changes the image matters. In Melius, upscaling and enhancement are connected nodes in a larger pipeline rather than a standalone round trip."},{"question":"Is Magnific's upscaler better than Melius?","answer":"Magnific's creative upscaler is genuinely strong at inventing plausible detail, and for pure maximum-detail upscaling it is a specialist worth using. Melius optimizes for the whole creative pipeline instead of one step, so the question is less which upscaler wins and more whether you want a standalone enhancer or a workspace where enhancement is one connected node."},{"question":"Does Melius have a canvas?","answer":"Yes. Melius is built canvas-first: a node-based canvas where prompts, images, video and audio are connected nodes, with Mel to plan and wire the work and real-time multiplayer for teams."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-magnific-does-well","title":"What Magnific does well"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1067","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1066","text":"Magnific made its name as a creative upscaler, and it is still one of the best at it: push an image through and it doesn't just enlarge, it invents plausible new detail, texture and lighting, with sliders to dial how much it reimagines versus preserves.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1071","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1068","text":"It is no longer only an upscaler, though. Backed by Freepik's platform it has grown into a genuine node canvas with an in-canvas agent, a timeline video editor and model training, which makes it one of the closest tools to Melius in shape. So a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1069","text":"Magnific alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1070","text":" comparison can't lean on \"we have a canvas and an agent\" either. The honest differences are how far the agent reaches, how a team works on it at once, and how it plugs into your own stack. Here's a fair look.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1073","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1072","text":"What Magnific does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-magnific-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1075","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1074","text":"Magnific's creative upscaling is best-in-class at inventing detail, and its Mystic model, Relight tools and model training give real control over texture, lighting and consistency. Beyond that it now runs a live node canvas with multiplayer, an agent that wires and runs nodes, a timeline video editor and a huge stock library. It is a capable, well-funded platform, not a one-trick upscaler, and worth taking seriously.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1077","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1076","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1080","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1078","text":"The agent and MCP stop at generation. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1079","text":"Its MCP and integrations are described as generating assets rather than building or running the canvas remotely, and there's no native Slack workflow, so an external agent can make images but can't operate the canvas end to end for you.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1083","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1081","text":"Deterministic flows, not team skills. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1082","text":"Customization runs through preset flows rather than natural-language, team-defined slash-command skills, so teaching the agent your brand voice as reusable commands isn't really the model.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1086","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1084","text":"Detail that drifts. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1085","text":"The same hallucination that makes the upscaler impressive can \"overcook\" an image, inventing detail that diverges from the original, especially on photorealistic portraits.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1089","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1087","text":"Premium pricing, no free trial. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1088","text":"Users report no free tier to test with and a strict no-refund policy, so evaluating it means paying up front, and heavy trial-and-error burns credits.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1091","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1090","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1093","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1092","text":"Melius and Magnific overlap more than most pairs in this list, so the differences are about how far the agent reaches, not whether one exists.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1096","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1094","text":"An agent that reaches past the canvas. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1095","text":"Mel plans and runs multi-step work on the canvas and also inside Slack, so a request, an approval and a finished download can happen in the thread where briefs actually arrive, not only in the app.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1099","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1097","text":"A canvas-level MCP. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1098","text":"An external agent like Claude can build and run the Melius canvas itself, creating nodes, wiring them and executing, rather than only calling a generation endpoint. That's the difference between an agent that operates your workspace and one that just returns assets.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1102","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1100","text":"Teach it your brand, run many at once. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1101","text":"Give the agent brand instructions plus reference images and save custom slash-command skills, then run several agents concurrently with visible presence on the canvas, personalization and a workforce, not a single assistant.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1111","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1105","href":"/blog/best-ai-photo-background-editing-tools","isNewTab":false},{"_type":"link","_key":"b1108","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1103","text":"Resize and enhance in-line, one subscription. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1104","text":"Magic resize, image enhancement and ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1106","text":"background removal","marks":["b1105"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1107","text":" live as nodes, so an upscale flows straight into the next step, and every image, video and audio model shares ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1109","text":"one subscription","marks":["b1108"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1110","text":" with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1114","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1112","text":"Your own work, semantically searchable. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1113","text":"Past Magnific's stock library, every image you generate or upload is auto-indexed by content, so you find your own past work by describing it rather than remembering a filename or re-upscaling from scratch.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b1115","rows":[{"_key":"b1116","cells":[{"_key":"b1117","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1119","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1118","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1120","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1122","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1121","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1123","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1125","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1124","text":"Magnific","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1126","cells":[{"_key":"b1127","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1129","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1128","text":"Core focus","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1130","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1132","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1131","text":"Agent-run creative workspace","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1133","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1135","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1134","text":"Upscaling heritage, now a full suite","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1136","cells":[{"_key":"b1137","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1139","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1138","text":"Node canvas + in-canvas agent","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1140","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1142","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1141","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1143","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1145","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1144","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1146","cells":[{"_key":"b1147","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1149","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1148","text":"Agent in Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1150","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1152","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1151","text":"Full workflow in a thread","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1153","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1155","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1154","text":"Not native","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1156","cells":[{"_key":"b1157","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1159","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1158","text":"Canvas-level MCP","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1160","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1162","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1161","text":"Builds & runs the canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1163","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1165","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1164","text":"Generation-only","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1167","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1166","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1169","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1168","text":"If your job is squeezing maximum detail out of a single image, or you want the deepest timeline video editing, Magnific is a strong, well-funded choice and worth keeping in the toolbox. If the bottleneck is throughput across a team, an agent that runs the workflow in Slack and on the canvas, is drivable from your own AI tools, and learns your brand as reusable skills, Melius reaches further with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1174","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1171","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1170","text":"Put your whole workflow on one canvas. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1172","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b1171"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1173","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1176","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1175","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b1177","items":"$20:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:post:faq"}]}}],"$L35","$L36"]}]]}]]}]
